<title>UK: LucasVarity up as Kleinwort repeats buy.</title>
<headline>LucasVarity up as Kleinwort repeats buy.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in LucasVarity rose after brokerage Kleinwort Benson reiterated a buy recommendation, traders said.</p>
<p>By 1210 GMT, LucasVarity shares were up 7p to 248-1/2p on trading volume of 2.3 million. The shares had fallen last week after reaching a peak at 250p.</p>
<p>&quot;There's the buy note and people are interested at these lower levels,&quot; said one trader.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
